---
description: Core engineering rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `PROJECT_BLUEPRINT.md`. Before coding, inspect existing code and reuse components, hooks, services, types, schemas, and next-intl keys. No new dependency if one already fits. Do not edit unrelated files.

Code must be type-safe, modular, secure, accessible, and responsive.

Never: needless `any`, hardcoded UI text or API URLs, secrets, duplicated logic or components, skipped validation or auth, extra global state, missing loading/error/empty states, or Server-to-Client without a reason. next-intl only.

Before finishing, run the relevant typecheck, lint, and tests.
